GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Delete user that does not exist (expect 404 Not Found)
DELETE {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

